OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer 'thankful to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter falling through roof in workplace
OL,5,Aaccident
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 80 people have died and over
OL,8,F1,800 people have suffered major
OL,9,Finjuries in workplace accidents across
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland during the last five
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FThe majority of the deaths were as a
OL,14,Fresult of falls from a height, followed
OL,15,Fby machinery related incidents.
OL,17,FIt comes as farmer Richard Spence has
OL,18,Fbeen raising awareness about the
OL,19,Fdangers of working at heights, after a
OL,20,Fworkplace fall left him with a brain
OL,21,Finjury.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
