OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer 'thankful to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter falling through roof in workplace
OL,5,Aaccident
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I would say to anyone who is thinking
OL,8,Fof taking a risk like that during their
OL,9,Fworking day, stop and really think
OL,10,Fabout it," he said.
